,"end":18,"text":"妃無寵太子宮人製新麗衣裳及首飾而后牀"},{"pdf_page":21,"half":"右","leaf":"十八下","column_from_right":7,"start":0,"end":18,"text":"帷陳故古舊釵鑷十餘枚永明十一年為皇太"},{"pdf_page":21,"half":"右","leaf":"十八下","column_from_right":8,"start":0,"end":18,"text":"孫太妃鬱林即位尊為皇太后稱宣德宮置男"},{"pdf_page":21,"half":"右","leaf":"十八下","column_from_right":9,"start":0,"end":18,"text":"左右三十人前代所未有也贈后父曄之金紫"},{"pdf_page":21,"half":"左","leaf":"十九上","column_from_right":1,"start":0,"end":18,"text":"光祿大夫母桓氏豐安縣君其年十二月備法"},{"pdf_page":21,"half":"左","leaf":"十九上","column_from_right":2,"start":0,"end":18,"text":"駕謁太廟明帝即位出居鄱陽王故第為宣德"},{"pdf_page":21,"half":"左","leaf":"十九上","column_from_right":3,"start":0,"end":1,"text":"宮"}]},"chapter_id":"c-nanshi-011-wangbaoming-izumo","book_id":"b-nanshi-011","work_id":"w-nanshi","source_id":"s-nanshi-011-wangbaoming-izumo"},{"id":"c-nanshi-011-wangbaoming:p001","text":"文安王皇后諱寶明，琅邪臨沂人也。祖韶之，吳興太守。父曄之，太宰祭酒。宋世，高帝為文惠太子納后，建元元年，為南郡王妃。四年，為皇太子妃，無寵。太子為宮人制新麗衣裳及首飾，而后床帷陳故，古舊釵鑷十餘枚。永明十一年，為皇太孫太妃。鬱林即位，尊為皇太后，稱宣德宮，置男左右三十人，前代所未有也。贈后父曄之金紫光祿大夫，母桓氏豐安縣君。其年十二月，備法駕謁太廟。明帝即位，出居鄱陽王故第，為宣德宮。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-nanshi-011-wangbaoming:p001:m0000","start":0,"end":5,"surface":"文安王皇后","person_id":"m9u_v4i_tk5","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"后傳首段具名及世系。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-011-wangbaoming:p001:m0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"寶明","person_id":"m9u_v4i_tk5","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"后傳首段具名及世系。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-011-wangbaoming:p001:m0017","start":17,"end":19,"surface":"韶之","person_id":"yfa_tz5_3ge","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"后傳首段具名及世系。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-011-wangbaoming:p001:m0026","start":26,"end":28,"surface":"曄之","person_id":"e8b_fms_9mk","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"后傳首段具名及世系。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-011-wangbaoming:p001:m0037","start":37,"end":39,"surface":"高帝","person_id":"47p_kjh_ez7",